  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes - v2.0.5 (2026-11-26)\n\n\t\t\t✨ Major Features & Additions:\n\n\t\t\t1. Automatic Resilient Retry Policy (ISQLRetryPolicy & SQLRetryPolicy)\n\t\t\t- Configurable automatic retries for transient SQL Server and Azure SQL failures\n\t\t\t(Deadlocks 1205, timeouts -2, throttling, network drops, Azure failover).\n\t\t\t- Exponential backoff with customizable multiplier and randomized jitter (+/- 25%) to\n\t\t\tprevent synchronized retry storms.\n\t\t\t- Non-idempotent write safety guard: automatically aborts mid-execution write retries\n\t\t\tunless explicitly enabled or verified as rolled-back deadlocks.\n\t\t\t- Full CancellationToken propagation across database calls, bulk copy, transactions, readers, and retry backoff delays.\n\n\t\t\t2. SQL Query Performance Monitoring & Diagnostics (ISQLPerformanceMonitor)\n\t\t\t- Monotonic Stopwatch-based execution duration timing with zero allocation overhead.\n\t\t\t- Slow-query detection and structured logging with configurable thresholds.\n\t\t\t- Security-first parameter tracking: records parameter names while strictly excluding\n\t\t\tsensitive parameter values.\n\t\t\t- OpenTelemetry distributed tracing via ActivitySource\n\t\t\t(\"SQLStoredProcedureCommandsFunctions\").\n\t\t\t- Ambient correlation tracking via SQLCorrelationContext (AsyncLocal<string?> and\n\t\t\tActivity.Current fallback).\n\n\t\t\t3. Automatic Dependency Injection (AddSQLStoredProcedureFunctions)\n\t\t\t- Native IServiceCollection extension methods with options pattern\n\t\t\t(IOptions<SQLCommandsOptions>).\n\t\t\t- Scoped database executor (ISQLStoredProcedureExecutor) ensuring zero connection leaks\n\t\t\tand pooled per-request lifecycles.\n\t\t\t- Multi-database / named connection factory (ISQLStoredProcedureExecutorFactory).\n\n\t\t\t4. Advanced Stored Procedure Multi-Result Mapping (ExecuteMultipleAsync)\n\t\t\t- Direct streaming of complex multi-result stored procedures into strongly-typed POCO\n\t\t\tcollections (IReadOnlyList<T>) with zero DataTable allocations.\n\t\t\t- Support for up to 5 generic result sets (SQLMultipleResult<T1, T2, ...>) with\n\t\t\tdirect tuple deconstruction:\n\t\t\t(IReadOnlyList<CustomerDto> customers, IReadOnlyList<OrderDto> orders,\n\t\t\tIReadOnlyList<AddressDto> addresses) = result;\n\t\t\t- Pre-computed property reflection and column-ordinal caching per result set.\n\t\t\t- Native support for Enums, Guids, Nullables, DateOnly, TimeOnly, and [MapFrom]\n\t\t\tattribute mappings.\n\t\t\t- Clear distinction between empty result sets and missing result sets\n\t\t\t(SQLMissingResultSetException).\n\t\t\t- Anonymous parameter object support: SQLParamHelper.ToSqlParameters(new { CustomerId =\n\t\t\t1 }).\n\n\t\t\t5. C# 12 & Modern Code Quality\n\t\t\t- Modernized to C# 12 primary constructors across all classes and record structs.\n\t\t\t- Clean, bracket-free single-line control flow syntax.\n\t\t\t- Standardized all APIs to uppercase SQL naming convention.",
